{"step_index":363,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T06:52:48Z","thinking":"**Examining App.js Level 1**\n\nOkay, I've started examining the `js/app.js` file, specifically the Level 1 clothing handler. I'm focusing on the `this.level1Dressed` object and its initial state. The conditional logic within `applyClothingItem` is now clear, particularly how it sets the clothing flags and calls the renderer for a 'soft' shirt when appropriate. The code does seem fairly well structured and easy to follow. I will examine how pants are handled next.\n\n\n**Analyzing Level 7 Functionality**\n\nI've shifted my attention to Level 7 and its interaction design. I see that it involves voice control and posture adjustments. The feedback system for the volume control is good, giving direction on the next desired action. I can see the states for volume level and leg position, and the code updates a pose in the renderer when the whisper is successful. I'm noting the clear prompts and success messages in Vietnamese.\n\n\n**Investigating Level 8 Logic**\n\nI'm now diving into Level 8's implementation. It starts with a plane landing sequence with a seatbelt prompt in Vietnamese and a disabled unbuckle button that activates after a timer. Unbuckling the belt updates the renderer's seatbelt state, triggering a prompt to find a red teddy bear suitcase.  I'm noting the carousel with suitcase validation, including the incorrect bag feedback and correct bag celebration, along with the reward states, which unlock level 9.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/**\n * app.js - Main Controller for \"Cùng Bé Bin Đi Máy Bay\" (8 Levels)\n * Chuẩn Storybook 2D Co-Play (BIN_SOFT_STORYBOOK_2D_V1)\n * - Không SpeechSynthesis / Không đọc tự động\n * - Gameplay chỉ đổi state qua window.binRenderer\n * - Phản hồi tương tác thân thiện, không lộ trước đáp án\n */\n\nclass KidFlightApp {\n    constructor() {\n        this.currentScreen = 1;\n        this.totalScreens = 8;\n        this.maxUnlockedLevel = 1;\n\n        // Tránh duplicate event listeners\n        this.levelInitialized = {\n            1: false, 2: false, 3: false, 4: false,\n            5: false, 6: false, 7: false, 8: false\n        };\n\n        // State theo dõi các nhiệm vụ\n        this.level1Dressed = { shirt: false, pants: false, shoes: false };\n        this.level2Packed = 0;\n        this.level3Steps = { checkin: false, xrayCount: 0, gate: false };\n        this.level4Completed = false;\n        this.level5Belt = { inserted: false, earRelieved: false };\n        this.level6Clouds = { c1: false, c2: false, c3: false, c4: false };\n        this.level7Tasks = { volume: false, leg: false };\n        this.level8State = { planeStopped: false, unbuckled: false, baggage: false };\n\n        this.parentHoldStart = 0;\n        this.parentHoldReqId = null;\n\n        this.init();\n    }\n\n    init() {\n        this.bindGlobalEvents();\n        if (window.binRenderer) {\n            window.binRenderer.updateAll();\n        }\n        this.initLevel(1);\n        this.showScreen(1);\n    }\n\n    // --- BIỂN BÁO LỜI THOẠI BA MẸ ĐỌC (KHÔNG SPEECH SYNTHESIS) ---\n    showParentPrompt(speaker, text) {\n        if (window.dialogueMgr) {\n            window.dialogueMgr.show(speaker, text);\n        }\n    }\n\n    // --- NAVIGATION & PROGRESS LOCKING CONTROLLER ---\n    unlockLevel(levelNum) {\n        if (levelNum > this.maxUnlockedLevel && levelNum <= this.totalScreens) {\n            this.maxUnlockedLevel = levelNum;\n            const dot = document.querySelector(`.stage-dot[data-screen=\"${levelNum}\"]`);\n            if (dot) {\n                dot.classList.remove('locked');\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    showScreen(screenNum) {\n        if (screenNum < 1 || screenNum > this.totalScreens) return;\n\n        if (this.currentScreen === 5 && screenNum !== 5) {\n            if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.stopEngineSound();\n        }\n\n        this.currentScreen = screenNum;\n        this.unlockLevel(screenNum);\n\n        document.querySelectorAll('.screen').forEach((scr, idx) => {\n            if (idx + 1 === screenNum) {\n                scr.classList.add('active');\n            } else {\n                scr.classList.remove('active');\n            }\n        });\n\n        document.querySelectorAll('.stage-dot').forEach((dot, idx) => {\n            const level = idx + 1;\n            dot.classList.remove('active', 'completed', 'locked');\n\n            if (level === screenNum) {\n                dot.classList.add('active');\n            } else if (level < screenNum || level <= this.maxUnlockedLevel) {\n                dot.classList.add('completed');\n            } else {\n                dot.classList.add('locked');\n            }\n        });\n\n        this.updateCharacterForScreen(screenNum);\n        this.initLevel(screenNum);\n        this.setInitialScreenDialogue(screenNum);\n    }\n\n    updateCharacterForScreen(screenNum) {\n        if (!window.binRenderer) return;\n\n        switch (screenNum) {\n            case 1:\n                window.binRenderer.renderTo(document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl1'), 'level1_layers');\n                break;\n            case 2:\n            case 3:\n            case 4:\n                window.binRenderer.setPose('standing');\n                window.binRenderer.setSeatbelt('none');\n                break;\n            case 5:\n                window.binRenderer.setPose('seated');\n                window.binRenderer.setSeatbelt(this.level5Belt.inserted ? 'fastened' : 'open');\n                break;\n            case 6:\n                window.binRenderer.setPose('looking_window');\n                window.binRenderer.setSeatbelt('fastened');\n                break;\n            case 7:\n                if (this.level7Tasks.volume && !this.level7Tasks.leg) {\n                    window.binRenderer.setPose('whispering');\n                } else if (this.level7Tasks.leg) {\n                    window.binRenderer.setPose('sitting_neat');\n                } else {\n                    window.binRenderer.setPose('seated');\n                }\n                window.binRenderer.setSeatbelt('fastened');\n                break;\n            case 8:\n                if (this.level8State.baggage) {\n                    window.binRenderer.setPose('holding_badge');\n                } else {\n                    window.binRenderer.setPose('standing');\n                }\n                window.binRenderer.setSeatbelt(this.level8State.unbuckled ? 'open' : 'fastened');\n                break;\n        }\n    }\n\n    setInitialScreenDialogue(screenNum) {\n        switch (screenNum) {\n            case 1:\n                this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Bin sắp đi máy bay rồi. Con chọn bộ đồ nào giúp Bin dễ vận động nhé!”');\n                break;\n            case 2:\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Bin mang gì đi máy bay nhỉ? Con xếp vali giúp Bin nhé!”');\n                break;\n            case 3:\n                this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Đến chỗ kiểm tra an ninh rồi. Bin đi cùng Ba Mẹ và làm theo hướng dẫn nhé!”');\n                break;\n            case 4:\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Vé của Bin ghi số 03. Con tìm cổng số 03 nhé!”');\n                break;\n            case 5:\n                this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Con giúp Bin cài dây an toàn nhé!”');\n                break;\n            case 6:\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bin', '“Bin thấy đám mây giống hình gì nhỉ? Con nhìn cùng Bin nhé!”');\n                break;\n            case 7:\n                this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Trên máy bay mình nói nhỏ vừa đủ nghe nhé. Con giúp Bin nào!”');\n                break;\n            case 8:\n                this.level8State.planeStopped = false;\n                this.level8State.unbuckled = false;\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Máy bay đang chạy vào chỗ đỗ. Bin vẫn ngồi yên và giữ dây an toàn nhé!”');\n                \n                const unbuckleBtn = document.getElementById('unbuckle-latch-btn');\n                if (unbuckleBtn) {\n                    unbuckleBtn.setAttribute('disabled', 'true');\n                    unbuckleBtn.style.opacity = '0.6';\n                    unbuckleBtn.style.borderColor = '#78909C';\n                    unbuckleBtn.innerHTML = '<span>⏳ Máy bay đang chạy vào bãi đỗ...</span>';\n                }\n\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    this.level8State.planeStopped = true;\n                    if (unbuckleBtn) {\n                        unbuckleBtn.removeAttribute('disabled');\n                        unbuckleBtn.style.opacity = '1';\n                        unbuckleBtn.style.borderColor = '#00E676';\n                        unbuckleBtn.innerHTML = '<span>🔓 Máy bay đã dừng hẳn — Mở dây an toàn</span>';\n                    }\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Máy bay dừng hẳn rồi. Bây giờ mình mới mở dây nhé!”');\n                }, 2600);\n                break;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // --- GLOBAL EVENTS & CỔNG BA MẸ CONTROLLER ---\n    bindGlobalEvents() {\n        const parentBtn = document.getElementById('btn-parent-gate');\n        const holdCircle = document.getElementById('parent-ring-circle');\n        const modal = document.getElementById('parent-modal');\n        const closeModalBtn = document.getElementById('btn-close-parent');\n\n        if (parentBtn && holdCircle) {\n            const startHold = (e) => {\n                e.preventDefault();\n                this.parentHoldStart = Date.now();\n                const totalHold = 3000;\n\n                const updateRing = () => {\n                    const elapsed = Date.now() - this.parentHoldStart;\n                    const progress = Math.min(1, elapsed / totalHold);\n                    const offset = 175 - (175 * progress);\n                    holdCircle.style.strokeDashoffset = offset;\n\n                    if (progress >= 1) {\n                        if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playTing();\n                        modal.classList.add('open');\n                        resetHold();\n                    } else {\n                        this.parentHoldReqId = requestAnimationFrame(updateRing);\n                    }\n                };\n\n                this.parentHoldReqId = requestAnimationFrame(updateRing);\n            };\n\n            const resetHold = () => {\n                if (this.parentHoldReqId) cancelAnimationFrame(this.parentHoldReqId);\n                holdCircle.style.strokeDashoffset = 175;\n            };\n\n            parentBtn.addEventListener('pointerdown', startHold);\n            parentBtn.addEventListener('pointerup', resetHold);\n            parentBtn.addEventListener('pointerleave', resetHold);\n            parentBtn.addEventListener('pointercancel', resetHold);\n        }\n\n        if (closeModalBtn && modal) {\n            closeModalBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                modal.classList.remove('open');\n            });\n        }\n\n        const volSlider = document.getElementById('setting-volume');\n        if (volSlider) {\n            volSlider.addEventListener('input', (e) => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.volume = parseFloat(e.target.value);\n            });\n        }\n\n        const motionToggle = document.getElementById('setting-reduced-motion');\n        if (motionToggle) {\n            motionToggle.addEventListener('change', (e) => {\n                if (window.effectsMgr) window.effectsMgr.reducedMotion = e.target.checked;\n            });\n        }\n\n        const resetBtn = document.getElementById('btn-reset-app');\n        if (resetBtn) {\n            resetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                if (window.binRenderer) window.binRenderer.reset();\n                window.location.reload();\n            });\n        }\n\n        document.querySelectorAll('.jump-btn').forEach(btn => {\n            btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                const target = parseInt(btn.getAttribute('data-level'), 10);\n                if (target) {\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                    modal.classList.remove('open');\n                    this.unlockLevel(target);\n                    this.showScreen(target);\n                }\n            });\n        });\n\n        document.querySelectorAll('.stage-dot').forEach((dot) => {\n            dot.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                const targetScreen = parseInt(dot.getAttribute('data-screen'), 10);\n                if (!dot.classList.contains('locked') && targetScreen && targetScreen <= this.maxUnlockedLevel) {\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                    this.showScreen(targetScreen);\n                }\n            });\n        });\n    }\n\n    initLevel(levelNum) {\n        if (this.levelInitialized[levelNum]) return;\n        this.levelInitialized[levelNum] = true;\n\n        switch (levelNum) {\n            case 1: this.initLevel1(); break;\n            case 2: this.initLevel2(); break;\n            case 3: this.initLevel3(); break;\n            case 4: this.initLevel4(); break;\n            case 5: this.initLevel5(); break;\n            case 6: this.initLevel6(); break;\n            case 7: this.initLevel7(); break;\n            case 8: this.initLevel8(); break;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 1: CHỌN TRANG PHỤC (KHÔNG LỘ ĐÁP ÁN, FEEDBACK SAU THAO TÁC)\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel1() {\n        const clothesTiles = document.querySelectorAll('#screen-1 [data-clothing-item=\"true\"]');\n        const binTarget = document.getElementById('bin-dress-target');\n        const btnNext1 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-1');\n\n        const applyClothingItem = (tile) => {\n            const isFit = tile.getAttribute('data-fit') === 'soft';\n            const type = tile.getAttribute('data-type');\n            const binRect = binTarget.getBoundingClientRect();\n\n            if (isFit && window.binRenderer) {\n                // Áp dụng trực tiếp vào layer của Bé Bin\n                if (type === 'shirt') {\n                    this.level1Dressed.shirt = true;\n                    window.binRenderer.setShirt('soft');\n                } else if (type === 'pants') {\n                    this.level1Dressed.pants = true;\n                    window.binRenderer.setPants('soft');\n                } else if (type === 'shoes') {\n                    this.level1Dressed.shoes = true;\n                    window.binRenderer.setShoes('velcro');\n                }\n\n                if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                    window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(binRect.left + binRect.width / 2, binRect.top + binRect.height / 2);\n                }\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playTing();\n\n                this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Đúng rồi! Món này mềm và dễ vận động.”');\n\n                // Kiểm tra hoàn thành đủ 3 món\n                if (this.level1Dressed.shirt && this.level1Dressed.pants && this.level1Dressed.shoes) {\n                    this.unlockLevel(2);\n                    if (btnNext1) {\n                        btnNext1.classList.remove('hidden');\n                        btnNext1.classList.add('pop-in');\n                    }\n                }\n            } else {\n                tile.classList.add('shake-wobble');\n                setTimeout(() => { tile.classList.remove('shake-wobble'); }, 500);\n\n                tile.style.transition = 'transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)';\n                tile.style.transform = 'translate(0px, 0px)';\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playBoing();\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Món này hơi bất tiện. Con thử món khác nhé!”');\n            }\n        };\n\n        clothesTiles.forEach(tile => {\n            let startX = 0, startY = 0;\n            let isDragging = false;\n\n            const onDown = (e) => {\n                isDragging = true;\n                tile.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n                startX = e.clientX;\n                startY = e.clientY;\n                tile.style.zIndex = '999';\n            };\n\n            const onMove = (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                const dx = e.clientX - startX;\n                const dy = e.clientY - startY;\n                tile.style.transform = `translate(${dx}px, ${dy}px) scale(1.15)`;\n            };\n\n            const onUp = (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                isDragging = false;\n                tile.releasePointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n\n                const tileRect = tile.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const binRect = binTarget.getBoundingClientRect();\n\n                const isOver = !(\n                    tileRect.right < binRect.left ||\n                    tileRect.left > binRect.right ||\n                    tileRect.bottom < binRect.top ||\n                    tileRect.top > binRect.bottom\n                );\n\n                if (isOver) {\n                    applyClothingItem(tile);\n                    tile.style.transform = 'translate(0px, 0px)';\n                } else {\n                    tile.style.transition = 'transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)';\n                    tile.style.transform = 'translate(0px, 0px)';\n                }\n            };\n\n            tile.addEventListener('pointerdown', onDown);\n            tile.addEventListener('pointermove', onMove);\n            tile.addEventListener('pointerup', onUp);\n            tile.addEventListener('pointercancel', onUp);\n\n            tile.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                applyClothingItem(tile);\n            });\n        });\n\n        if (btnNext1) {\n            btnNext1.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.showScreen(2);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 2: XẾP VALI (PACK / ASK_PARENT / LEAVE_HOME)\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel2() {\n        const luggageItems = document.querySelectorAll('#screen-2 [data-luggage-item=\"true\"]');\n        const suitcase = document.getElementById('suitcase-target-lvl2');\n        const suitcaseInner = document.getElementById('suitcase-inner-lvl2');\n        const btnNext2 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-2');\n\n        const tryPackLuggage = (item) => {\n            if (item.classList.contains('packed')) return;\n            const category = item.getAttribute('data-category');\n            const suitcaseRect = suitcase.getBoundingClientRect();\n\n            if (category === 'PACK') {\n                item.classList.add('packed');\n                item.style.display = 'none';\n\n                if (suitcase) {\n                    suitcase.classList.add('packed-bounce');\n                    setTimeout(() => { suitcase.classList.remove('packed-bounce'); }, 450);\n                }\n\n                const icon = item.querySelector('.item-icon');\n                if (icon && icon.tagName === 'IMG') {\n                    const imgClone = document.createElement('img');\n                    imgClone.src = icon.src;\n                    imgClone.style.width = '52px';\n                    imgClone.style.height = '52px';\n                    imgClone.style.objectFit = 'contain';\n                    imgClone.className = 'pop-in';\n                    suitcaseInner.appendChild(imgClone);\n                } else {\n                    const iconSpan = document.createElement('span');\n                    iconSpan.textContent = icon ? icon.textContent : '📦';\n                    iconSpan.style.fontSize = '34px';\n                    iconSpan.className = 'pop-in';\n                    suitcaseInner.appendChild(iconSpan);\n                }\n\n                this.level2Packed++;\n\n                if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                    window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(suitcaseRect.left + suitcaseRect.width / 2, suitcaseRect.top + suitcaseRect.height / 2);\n                }\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playTing();\n\n                this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Ừ! Món này mình xếp vào vali nhé.”');\n\n                if (this.level2Packed >= 3) {\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Vali của Bin đã sẵn sàng rồi! Cùng đến sân bay thôi!”');\n                    this.unlockLevel(3);\n                    if (btnNext2) {\n                        btnNext2.classList.remove('hidden');\n                        btnNext2.classList.add('pop-in');\n                    }\n                }\n            } else if (category === 'ASK_PARENT') {\n                item.classList.add('shake-wobble');\n                setTimeout(() => { item.classList.remove('shake-wobble'); }, 500);\n\n                item.style.transition = 'transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)';\n                item.style.transform = 'translate(0px, 0px)';\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Món này mình hỏi Ba Mẹ trước nhé!”');\n            } else {\n                item.classList.add('shake-wobble');\n                setTimeout(() => { item.classList.remove('shake-wobble'); }, 500);\n\n                item.style.transition = 'transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)';\n                item.style.transform = 'translate(0px, 0px)';\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playBoing();\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Món này để Ba Mẹ giúp mình xử lý nhé.”');\n            }\n        };\n\n        luggageItems.forEach(item => {\n            let startX = 0, startY = 0;\n            let isDragging = false;\n\n            const onDown = (e) => {\n                if (item.classList.contains('packed')) return;\n                isDragging = true;\n                item.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n                startX = e.clientX;\n                startY = e.clientY;\n                item.style.zIndex = '999';\n            };\n\n            const onMove = (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                const dx = e.clientX - startX;\n                const dy = e.clientY - startY;\n                item.style.transform = `translate(${dx}px, ${dy}px) scale(1.15)`;\n            };\n\n            const onUp = (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                isDragging = false;\n                item.releasePointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n\n                const itemRect = item.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const suitcaseRect = suitcase.getBoundingClientRect();\n\n                const isOver = !(\n                    itemRect.right < suitcaseRect.left ||\n                    itemRect.left > suitcaseRect.right ||\n                    itemRect.bottom < suitcaseRect.top ||\n                    itemRect.top > suitcaseRect.bottom\n                );\n\n                if (isOver) {\n                    tryPackLuggage(item);\n                } else {\n                    item.style.transition = 'transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)';\n                    item.style.transform = 'translate(0px, 0px)';\n                }\n            };\n\n            item.addEventListener('pointerdown', onDown);\n            item.addEventListener('pointermove', onMove);\n            item.addEventListener('pointerup', onUp);\n            item.addEventListener('pointercancel', onUp);\n\n            item.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                if (!item.classList.contains('packed')) {\n                    tryPackLuggage(item);\n                }\n            });\n        });\n\n        if (btnNext2) {\n            btnNext2.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.showScreen(3);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 3: KIỂM TRA AN NINH (3 TRẠM)\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel3() {\n        const passCard = document.getElementById('pass-card-lvl3');\n        const stampBadge = document.getElementById('stamp-badge-lvl3');\n        const xrayBoxes = document.querySelectorAll('#screen-3 .xray-tap-box');\n        const gate = document.getElementById('gate-detector-lvl3');\n        const lamps = document.querySelectorAll('#screen-3 .gate-lamp-led');\n        const binMount3 = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl3');\n        const btnNext3 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-3');\n\n        if (passCard) {\n            passCard.onclick = () => {\n                if (this.level3Steps.checkin) return;\n                this.level3Steps.checkin = true;\n                if (stampBadge) stampBadge.classList.add('stamped');\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playStamp();\n\n                if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                    const r = passCard.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top + r.height / 2);\n                }\n\n                this.showParentPrompt('Tiếp viên', '“Vé của Bin xong rồi! Giờ soi chiếu vali nhé.”');\n                this.checkLevel3Completion();\n            };\n        }\n\n        xrayBoxes.forEach(box => {\n            box.onclick = () => {\n                if (box.getAttribute('data-revealed') === 'true') return;\n                box.setAttribute('data-revealed', 'true');\n                box.textContent = box.getAttribute('data-item');\n                box.style.background = '#FFF9C4';\n                box.classList.add('revealed-pulse');\n                this.level3Steps.xrayCount++;\n\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playTing();\n                if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                    const r = box.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top + r.height / 2);\n                }\n\n                if (this.level3Steps.xrayCount >= 3) {\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Vali của Bin an toàn rồi! Chạm để Bin qua cổng nhé.”');\n                    this.checkLevel3Completion();\n                }\n            };\n        });\n\n        if (gate) {\n            gate.onclick = () => {\n                if (this.level3Steps.gate) return;\n                this.level3Steps.gate = true;\n\n                lamps.forEach(l => l.classList.add('green-flash'));\n                if (binMount3) binMount3.style.transform = 'translateY(-14px) scale(1.1)';\n\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playBeepBoop();\n                if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                    const r = gate.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top + r.height / 2);\n                }\n\n                this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Giỏi lắm! Bin đã qua khu kiểm tra an ninh rồi.”');\n                this.checkLevel3Completion();\n            };\n        }\n\n        if (btnNext3) {\n            btnNext3.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.showScreen(4);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    checkLevel3Completion() {\n        const btnNext3 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-3');\n        if (this.level3Steps.checkin && this.level3Steps.xrayCount >= 3 && this.level3Steps.gate) {\n            this.unlockLevel(4);\n            if (btnNext3) {\n                btnNext3.classList.remove('hidden');\n                btnNext3.classList.add('pop-in');\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 4: RA CỔNG BAY (TÌM CỔNG 03)\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel4() {\n        const gatePillars = document.querySelectorAll('#screen-4 .gate-pillar');\n        const btnNext4 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-4');\n\n        gatePillars.forEach(pillar => {\n            pillar.onclick = () => {\n                const targetGate = pillar.getAttribute('data-gate');\n\n                if (targetGate === '03') {\n                    this.level4Completed = true;\n                    pillar.classList.add('matched');\n\n                    if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                        const r = pillar.getBoundingClientRect();\n                        window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top + r.height / 2);\n                    }\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playConnect();\n\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Tiếp viên', '“Đúng rồi! Cổng 03 đây rồi! Chào mừng Bin lên máy bay!”');\n                    this.unlockLevel(5);\n\n                    if (btnNext4) {\n                        btnNext4.classList.remove('hidden');\n                        btnNext4.classList.add('pop-in');\n                    }\n                } else {\n                    pillar.classList.add('shake-wobble');\n                    setTimeout(() => { pillar.classList.remove('shake-wobble'); }, 500);\n\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playBoing();\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Con nhìn lại số trên vé nhé!”');\n                }\n            };\n        });\n\n        if (btnNext4) {\n            btnNext4.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.showScreen(5);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 5: ĐAI AN TOÀN & UỐNG NƯỚC (RENDERER SEATBELT & DRINKING)\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel5() {\n        const strapLeft = document.getElementById('seatbelt-strap-lvl5');\n        const puzzleBox = document.getElementById('seatbelt-puzzle-lvl5');\n        const safetySign = document.getElementById('safety-sign-lvl5');\n        const knightCape = document.getElementById('bin-knight-cape');\n        const btnWater = document.getElementById('btn-drink-water-lvl5');\n        const earWaves = document.querySelectorAll('#screen-5 .ear-soundwave');\n        const btnNext5 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-5');\n\n        const tryBuckleBelt = () => {\n            if (this.level5Belt.inserted) return;\n            this.level5Belt.inserted = true;\n            puzzleBox.classList.add('seatbelt-buckled');\n\n            // Cập nhật trạng thái cài đai thật qua Renderer\n            if (window.binRenderer) {\n                window.binRenderer.setSeatbelt('fastened');\n            }\n\n            if (safetySign) safetySign.classList.add('green-safe');\n            if (knightCape) knightCape.classList.add('active');\n\n            if (window.audioMgr) {\n                window.audioMgr.playClack();\n                window.audioMgr.startEngineSound(0.22);\n            }\n\n            if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                const r = puzzleBox.getBoundingClientRect();\n                window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top + r.height / 2);\n            }\n\n            this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“CẠCH! Dây an toàn chắc chắn rồi!”');\n\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                earWaves.forEach(w => w.classList.remove('hidden'));\n                if (btnWater) btnWater.classList.remove('hidden');\n                this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Tai Bin hơi khó chịu. Bin uống một ngụm nước nhé.”');\n            }, 2500);\n        };\n\n        if (strapLeft && puzzleBox) {\n            let isDragging = false;\n            let startX = 0;\n\n            const onDown = (e) => {\n                if (this.level5Belt.inserted) return;\n                isDragging = true;\n                strapLeft.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n                startX = e.clientX;\n            };\n\n            const onMove = (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging || this.level5Belt.inserted) return;\n                const dx = Math.max(0, Math.min(45, e.clientX - startX));\n                strapLeft.style.transform = `translateX(${dx}px)`;\n\n                if (dx >= 35) {\n                    tryBuckleBelt();\n                }\n            };\n\n            const onUp = (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                isDragging = false;\n                strapLeft.releasePointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n                if (!this.level5Belt.inserted) {\n                    strapLeft.style.transform = 'translateX(0px)';\n                }\n            };\n\n            strapLeft.addEventListener('pointerdown', onDown);\n            strapLeft.addEventListener('pointermove', onMove);\n            strapLeft.addEventListener('pointerup', onUp);\n\n            puzzleBox.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                tryBuckleBelt();\n            });\n        }\n\n        if (btnWater) {\n            btnWater.onclick = () => {\n                if (this.level5Belt.earRelieved) return;\n                this.level5Belt.earRelieved = true;\n\n                // Pose uống nước thật\n                if (window.binRenderer) {\n                    window.binRenderer.setPose('drinking_water');\n                }\n\n                earWaves.forEach(w => w.classList.add('hidden'));\n\n                if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                    const binHead = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl5');\n                    if (binHead) {\n                        const r = binHead.getBoundingClientRect();\n                        window.effectsMgr.spawnMusicNotesAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top);\n                    }\n                }\n\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playDrinkWater();\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bin', '“Tai Bin dễ chịu hơn rồi!”');\n                this.unlockLevel(6);\n\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    if (window.binRenderer) {\n                        window.binRenderer.setPose('seated');\n                    }\n                }, 2800);\n\n                if (btnNext5) {\n                    btnNext5.classList.remove('hidden');\n                    btnNext5.classList.add('pop-in');\n                }\n            };\n        }\n\n        if (btnNext5) {\n            btnNext5.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.showScreen(6);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 6: NGẮM MÂY BIẾN HÌNH (BIN LOOKING WINDOW)\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel6() {\n        const cloudTiles = document.querySelectorAll('#screen-6 .morph-cloud-tile');\n        const btnNext6 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-6');\n\n        cloudTiles.forEach(tile => {\n            tile.onclick = () => {\n                if (tile.classList.contains('morphed')) return;\n                tile.classList.add('morphed');\n\n                const morphType = tile.getAttribute('data-morph');\n                const icon = tile.querySelector('.cloud-icon');\n                const label = tile.querySelector('.cloud-label');\n\n                if (morphType === 'bunny') {\n                    icon.textContent = '🐰';\n                    label.textContent = 'Chú thỏ';\n                    this.level6Clouds.c1 = true;\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Bin', '“Bin thấy giống chú thỏ! Còn con thấy giống gì?”');\n                } else if (morphType === 'car') {\n                    icon.textContent = '🚗';\n                    label.textContent = 'Chiếc ô tô';\n                    this.level6Clouds.c2 = true;\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Bin', '“Bin thấy giống ô tô chạy! Còn con thấy giống gì?”');\n                } else if (morphType === 'watermelon') {\n                    icon.textContent = '🍉';\n                    label.textContent = 'Miếng dưa hấu';\n                    this.level6Clouds.c3 = true;\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Bin', '“Bin thấy giống miếng dưa hấu! Còn con thấy giống gì?”');\n                } else if (morphType === 'bear') {\n                    icon.textContent = '🐻';\n                    label.textContent = 'Chú gấu';\n                    this.level6Clouds.c4 = true;\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Bin', '“Bin thấy giống chú gấu vẫy tay! Còn con thấy giống gì?”');\n                }\n\n                if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                    const r = tile.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top + r.height / 2);\n                }\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playBling();\n\n                if (this.level6Clouds.c1 && this.level6Clouds.c2 && this.level6Clouds.c3 && this.level6Clouds.c4) {\n                    this.unlockLevel(7);\n                    if (btnNext6) {\n                        btnNext6.classList.remove('hidden');\n                        btnNext6.classList.add('pop-in');\n                    }\n                }\n            };\n        });\n\n        if (btnNext6) {\n            btnNext6.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.showScreen(7);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 7: LỊCH SỰ (3 MỨC ÂM LƯỢNG & THU CHÂN)\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel7() {\n        const emotionBtns = document.querySelectorAll('#screen-7 .volume-emotion-btn');\n        const legTarget = document.getElementById('bin-leg-target');\n        const legLabel = document.getElementById('leg-status-label');\n        const btnNext7 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-7');\n\n        emotionBtns.forEach(btn => {\n            btn.onclick = () => {\n                emotionBtns.forEach(b => b.classList.remove('selected'));\n                btn.classList.add('selected');\n                const level = btn.getAttribute('data-level');\n\n                if (level === 'loud') {\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Ơ, hơi to rồi. Con thử nhỏ hơn nhé!”');\n                } else if (level === 'medium') {\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Nhỏ hơn một chút nữa nhé!”');\n                } else if (level === 'whisper') {\n                    this.level7Tasks.volume = true;\n                    if (window.binRenderer) {\n                        window.binRenderer.setPose('whispering');\n                    }\n\n                    if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                        const r = btn.getBoundingClientRect();\n                        window.effectsMgr.spawnFloatingHeartsAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top);\n                    }\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playTing();\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Bin', '“Đúng rồi! Mình nói nhỏ vừa đủ nghe nhé.”');\n\n                    if (!this.level7Tasks.leg) {\n                        setTimeout(() => {\n                            this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Bin thu chân gọn lại để không chạm ghế phía trước nhé!”');\n                        }, 2200);\n                    }\n\n                    this.checkLevel7Completion();\n                }\n            };\n        });\n\n        if (legTarget) {\n            legTarget.onclick = () => {\n                if (this.level7Tasks.leg) return;\n                this.level7Tasks.leg = true;\n                \n                if (window.binRenderer) {\n                    window.binRenderer.setPose('sitting_neat');\n                }\n\n                legTarget.style.transform = 'translateY(14px)';\n                if (legLabel) legLabel.textContent = 'Chân Bin đã thu lại ngay ngắn ✓';\n\n                if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                    const r = legTarget.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    window.effectsMgr.spawnFloatingHeartsAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top);\n                }\n\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playTing();\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Giỏi lắm! Bin ngồi gọn rồi, không đạp ghế trước!”');\n                this.checkLevel7Completion();\n            };\n        }\n\n        if (btnNext7) {\n            btnNext7.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.showScreen(8);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    checkLevel7Completion() {\n        const btnNext7 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-7');\n        if (this.level7Tasks.volume && this.level7Tasks.leg) {\n            this.unlockLevel(8);\n            if (btnNext7) {\n                btnNext7.classList.remove('hidden');\n                btnNext7.classList.add('pop-in');\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 8: HẠ CÁNH, MỞ ĐAI & NHẬN VALI THƯỞNG\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel8() {\n        const unbuckleLatch = document.getElementById('unbuckle-latch-btn');\n        const baggageCarousel = document.getElementById('baggage-carousel-lvl8');\n        const bags = document.querySelectorAll('#screen-8 .carousel-bag-tile');\n        const medalModal = document.getElementById('golden-medal-modal');\n        const btnReplay = document.getElementById('btn-replay-adventure');\n\n        if (unbuckleLatch) {\n            unbuckleLatch.onclick = () => {\n                if (!this.level8State.planeStopped) {\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Máy bay đang chạy vào chỗ đỗ. Bin vẫn ngồi yên và giữ dây an toàn nhé!”');\n                    return;\n                }\n\n                if (this.level8State.unbuckled) return;\n                this.level8State.unbuckled = true;\n                \n                if (window.binRenderer) {\n                    window.binRenderer.setSeatbelt('open');\n                }\n\n                unbuckleLatch.innerHTML = '<span>🔓 Đai an toàn đã mở ✓</span>';\n                unbuckleLatch.style.borderColor = '#00E676';\n\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playUnbuckle();\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Con tìm chiếc vali đỏ có hình gấu của Bin nhé!”');\n\n                if (baggageCarousel) baggageCarousel.classList.remove('hidden');\n            };\n        }\n\n        bags.forEach(bag => {\n            bag.onclick = () => {\n                if (!this.level8State.unbuckled) {\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Máy bay dừng hẳn rồi. Bây giờ mình mới mở dây an toàn nhé!”');\n                    return;\n                }\n\n                const isBinBag = bag.getAttribute('data-is-bin') === 'true';\n\n                if (isBinBag) {\n                    this.level8State.baggage = true;\n                    bag.style.transform = 'scale(1.3) translateY(-14px)';\n                    const track = document.querySelector('.carousel-suitcases-track');\n                    if (track) track.classList.add('paused');\n\n                    if (window.binRenderer) {\n                        window.binRenderer.setPose('holding_badge');\n                    }\n\n                    if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                        window.effectsMgr.startCelebrationFireworks(3000);\n                    }\n\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playFanfare();\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Hoan hô! Bin tìm đúng vali rồi!”');\n\n                    setTimeout(() => {\n                        if (medalModal) medalModal.classList.add('show');\n                    }, 1200);\n                } else {\n                    bag.classList.add('shake-wobble');\n                    setTimeout(() => { bag.classList.remove('shake-wobble'); }, 500);\n\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playBoing();\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Vali này của bạn khác rồi. Con tìm lại nhé!”');\n                }\n            };\n        });\n\n        if (btnReplay) {\n            btnReplay.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                if (window.binRenderer) window.binRenderer.reset();\n                window.location.reload();\n            };\n        }\n    }\n}\n\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n    window.kidFlightApp = new KidFlightApp();\n});\n","Description":"Cập nhật app.js hoàn thiện toàn bộ state machine và flow 8 Level","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"c:\\Demo.plane\\js\\app.js","toolAction":"Writing file","toolSummary":"Update app.js state logic"}}]}
