{"step_index":408,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T07:04:00Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-26T14:04:00+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-08-26T14:04:00+07:00\n{\"name\":\"jeans_stiff.svg\",\"sizeBytes\":\"1600\"